## Database

- PostgreSQL
- Prisma ORM

## Background processing

- Redis
- BullMQ

Use background workers for:
- Webhook processing
- AI requests
- Document processing
- Analytics jobs
- Other asynchronous tasks

## AI

Use the OpenAI API through a dedicated AI service layer.

Implement:
- Language detection
- Intent classification
- Context retrieval
- Structured tool calling
- Response validation
- Conversation context management
- Human handover

Do not expose API keys to the frontend.

## Vector search

Use PostgreSQL with pgvector when semantic retrieval is required.

Use structured database queries for product prices, stock, and other exact business information.

## Storage

Use S3-compatible object storage for uploaded images and documents.

## Deployment

Prepare the application for Docker-based deployment.

The initial deployment environment may use Render.

Keep the public website, API, and background worker deployable independently.

